## Negative result: GZ_RENDERING_OGRE2_WORKER_THREAD (tested 21:35, REVERTED)
Hypothesis: the abort is a race on the render thread; ogre2's dedicated worker
thread might avoid it.
Test: exported GZ_RENDERING_OGRE2_WORKER_THREAD=1 from ao-sim-gui-client.sh
      (unit untouched; EGL vendor pin and CDI passthrough unchanged).
Result: FAILED. Identical abort, same signature, same timing:
  21:35:43.802  Camera pose topic advertised on [/gui/camera/pose]
  21:35:44.768  Qt has caught an exception thrown from an event handler   (+0.966s)
                terminate ... what(): basic_string: construction from null
NVIDIA EGL context unaffected - EGL_VENDOR stayed NVIDIA.
CONCLUSION: the render thread model is not the cause. Variable removed from the
launcher; zero references remain. Recorded so it is not retried blindly.
